{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN BOTANAROOTS — INTERACTIVE FAQ ACCORDION (POSITION 2 IN PDP FLOW)
  Replaces the static raw text FAQ inside product description with high-converting,
  accessible, interactive Accordion with smooth transitions and animated chevrons.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="zv-botana-faq-section" id="botanaroots-faq-accordion">
  <div class="zv-botana-faq-header">
    <span class="zv-botana-faq-badge">GOT QUESTIONS?</span>
    <h3 class="zv-botana-faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
    <p class="zv-botana-faq-subtitle">Everything you need to know about Zavelyn BotanaRoots Organic Batana Oil.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zv-botana-faq-accordion" role="region" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions Accordion">
    
    <!-- Item 1 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">Can I use this on color-treated, bleached, or chemically straightened hair?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>Yes! Zavelyn BotanaRoots™ is 100% natural, sulfate-free, and color-safe. It actually helps repair damage caused by bleaching and hot styling tools.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Item 2 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">How soon will I see visible results?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>Most customers report a reduction in shedding within 10-14 days. Visible new baby hair growth and thickening of sparse areas typically appears between 4 to 8 weeks of daily use.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Item 3 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">Is it suitable for both men and women?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>Absolutely. BotanaRoots™ is universally effective for all hair types (Type 1 straight to Type 4 coily) and works equally well on receding men's hairlines and thinning women's crowns.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Item 4 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">How do I apply Zavelyn BotanaRoots for best results?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>Warm a few drops between your palms and gently massage into your scalp in circular motions for 3–5 minutes. Leave on for at least 30 minutes, or overnight as an intensive scalp treatment before washing.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Item 5 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">Is it 100% pure raw batana oil with no added chemicals?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>Yes. Our Batana Oil is sustainably wild-harvested in La Mosquitia, Honduras, following centuries-old artisanal roasting methods. It contains zero mineral oils, parabens, sulfates, silicones, or synthetic fragrances.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Item 6 -->
    <details class="zv-botana-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-botana-faq-summary">
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-qtext">How does the 30-Day Return Guarantee work?</span>
        <span class="zv-botana-faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="zv-botana-faq-content">
        <p>We want you to experience BotanaRoots completely risk-free. If you are not satisfied with your purchase within 30 days of delivery, simply email our customer support team for an effortless return and refund.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
.zv-botana-faq-section {
  margin: 45px 0 45px 0;
  padding: 35px 24px;
  background: #FAFAF8;
  border: 1px solid #EAEAE4;
  border-radius: 16px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.zv-botana-faq-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 26px;
}

.zv-botana-faq-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: rgba(23, 67, 60, 0.08);
  color: #17433C;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 5px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.zv-botana-faq-title {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #17433C;
  margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.zv-botana-faq-subtitle {
  font-size: 14.5px;
  color: #555555;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 600px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.zv-botana-faq-accordion {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}

.zv-botana-faq-item {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.zv-botana-faq-item[open] {
  border-color: #17433C;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(23, 67, 60, 0.08);
}

.zv-botana-faq-summary {
  list-style: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 17px 20px;
  gap: 16px;
  user-select: none;
  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
}

.zv-botana-faq-summary:hover {
  background-color: #FBFBFA;
}

.zv-botana-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}

.zv-botana-faq-qtext {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #17433C;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.zv-botana-faq-chevron {
  flex: 0 0 20px;
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #17433C;
  transition: transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.zv-botana-faq-item[open] .zv-botana-faq-chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
}

.zv-botana-faq-content {
  padding: 0 20px 18px 20px;
  font-size: 14.5px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #4B5563;
  border-top: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
  padding-top: 14px;
}

.zv-botana-faq-content p {
  margin: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .zv-botana-faq-section {
    margin: 32px 0 35px 0;
    padding: 24px 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .zv-botana-faq-title {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .zv-botana-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }
  .zv-botana-faq-summary {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .zv-botana-faq-qtext {
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .zv-botana-faq-content {
    padding: 0 16px 15px 16px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }
}
</style>

<script>
(function() {
  function initFaqAccordion() {
    var accordion = document.querySelector('.zv-botana-faq-accordion');
    if (!accordion || accordion.dataset.initialized) return;
    accordion.dataset.initialized = 'true';

    var items = accordion.querySelectorAll('.zv-botana-faq-item');
    items.forEach(function(item) {
      item.addEventListener('toggle', function() {
        if (item.open) {
          items.forEach(function(other) {
            if (other !== item && other.open) {
              other.open = false;
            }
          });
        }
      });
    });
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initFaqAccordion);
  } else {
    initFaqAccordion();
  }
})();
</script>
